<div class=3D"WordSection1">
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">Hi all,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&=
nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; This is the weekly test report for Yocto 1.2 M4 RC4. Unti=
l now, all weekly test cases are already performed and some fullpass test c=
ases are also finished. There are 3 new bugs reported for ADT and multilib =
-
 that pseudo-nativesdk causes segfault on Fedora 16 for runqem-extract-sdk;=
 lib64 sdk build against qemux86 failed; fonts corrupted with ipk build whe=
n multilib enabled.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&=
nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; For ADT, the testing is not finished yet. The pseudo-nati=
vesdk issue causes different failures on Fedora 16 and Opensuse 12.1. Clutt=
er cases for qemux86/x86-64 are all blocked due to glxgears failure.<o:p></=
o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&=
nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; For Hob, all functions could work well without new issues=
 found.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&=
nbsp;&nbsp; For build system, the testing is not finished either. Testing f=
or x32, btrfs and multilib is finished. Multilib could pass build for sato,=
 but it has 2 new issues as listed above when building sdk or ipk images.<o=
:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&=
nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; For BSPs and QEMU targets, there is no new issue found in=
 weekly testing.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"text-indent:21.0pt"><span lang=3D"EN-US">No=
te: The test report is archived @
<a href=3D"https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Yocto_1.2_Milestone_Test_Repo=
rt">https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Yocto_1.2_Milestone_Test_Report</a>.
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><b><span lang=3D"EN-US" style=3D"font-size:10.0pt;fo=
nt-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">Test Summary:<o:p></o:p=
